Maintainer: Maxim Kurbatov <maxim+keen-pbr@kurb.me>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, pkg-config, g++, ninja-build, libcurl4-openssl-dev | libcurl4-gnutls-dev, libnl-3-dev, libnl-route-3-dev, libfmt-dev, libunwind-dev, nlohmann-json3-dev, zlib1g-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/shendr404/keen-pbr-sing

Package: keen-pbr
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, conntrack, iptables | nftables
Suggests: xtables-addons-dkms, dnsmasq
Description: keen-pbr-sing policy routing with REST API and Web UI
 keen-pbr-sing routes selected traffic through a sing-box TUN on Keenetic
 and shows per-outbound traffic. Based on keen-pbr by Maxim Kurbatov.
 The package name remains keen-pbr.
 This package includes the daemon, REST API, and bundled frontend assets.
 Install xtables-addons-dkms only when using the iptables backend.
